# Kabootar: `this` (class) vs `self` (struct)

| Konstruktion | Receiver | Status |
|--------------|----------|--------|
| **`class`** | **`this`** | ✅ |
| **`struct`** | **`self`** / `&self` / `&mut self` | ✅ R1 |

- Class-metoder: `this` (inte `self`)
- Struct-metoder: `self` / `&self` / `&mut self`
- Dataobjekt-kedja = **Parent** (`getParent`/`setParent`), inte prototype

Se `docs/CLASSES.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md` (Våg R).
